<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-KLUIVERT,BOGARDE TO LEAVE AJAX - ANP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KLUIVERT,BOGARDE TO LEAVE AJAX - ANP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former European champions Ajax Amsterdam said on Thursday that both striker Patrick Kluivert and utility player Winston Bogarde would leave the club at the end of the current season, Dutch ANP news agency reported.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
